    },
    {
      "lens": "compare",
      "kicker": "FAST OR NOT",
      "left": {
        "label": "Nobody accepts",
        "tone": "muted",
        "lines": [
          "Walk hits a file nobody imports",
          "Server sends full-reload",
          "Page reloads, state is gone"
        ]
      },
      "right": {
        "label": "A module accepts",
        "tone": "accent",
        "lines": [
          "The walk stops at the boundary",
          "Server sends update",
          "Only that chain re-runs"
        ]
      },
      "caption": "Without an `accept` boundary up the chain, Vite gives up and does a **full page reload**.",
      "notes": "hmr.ts:857 returns true (dead end) when a module has no importers; updateModules then sends { type: 'full-reload' } (hmr.ts:765). Framework plugins such as React and Vue add hot.accept to components for you."
